blur-my-shell@aunetx|org.gnome.shell.extensions.blur-my-shell.dash-to-dock|brightness|0.65
blur-my-shell@aunetx|org.gnome.shell.extensions.blur-my-shell.dash-to-dock|corner-radius|18
